# Frontend UX

- Evidence-first on company dossiers; sticky section nav for long pages.
- Universe table is the home hero job — do not bury it under demo charts.
- Always show score **level + Δ** (MoM/QoQ/YoY/PoP) when history exists.
- Desk/Research: sync tabs via `?tab=`; sticky company picker where multi-tab.
- API only through `lib/api.ts`. Prefer `Toast` / `Skeleton` over bare muted status.
- Mobile: usable nav (toggle); desktop-first dense tables OK with horizontal scroll.
- Visual: Source Serif + IBM Plex; paper/ink palette; no purple glow / emoji chrome.
- Full prompt: `docs/prompts/PROFESSIONAL_SITE_PROMPT.md` · kb `docs/kb/06-frontend-ux.md`.
